<section class="module-hero"><div><span class="module-kicker">Discussion IFMAP</span><h1><?= htmlspecialchars($conversation['title']?:'Conversation #'.$conversation['id']) ?></h1><p>Répondez directement à l’utilisateur. Les nouveaux messages apparaissent dans le widget public lors de sa prochaine synchronisation.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/admin/discussions">← Toutes les discussions</a></section>
<section class="module-panel"><div class="admin-chat-thread"><?php foreach($messages as $message): $isStaff=(int)($message['sender_id']??0)===(int)($_SESSION['user']['id']??0); ?><article class="admin-chat-message <?= $isStaff?'staff':'' ?> <?= $message['message_type']==='system'?'system':'' ?>"><div><strong><?= htmlspecialchars($message['message_type']==='system'?'IFMAP':($message['sender_name']??'Conseiller IFMAP')) ?></strong><small><?= htmlspecialchars($message['created_at']) ?></small></div><p><?= nl2br(htmlspecialchars($message['message'])) ?></p><?php if(!empty($message['attachment_path'])): ?><a href="<?= htmlspecialchars($message['attachment_path']) ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📎 <?= htmlspecialchars(basename($message['attachment_path'])) ?></a><?php endif ?></article><?php endforeach ?></div><form class="admin-chat-reply" method="post" action="/admin/discussion/envoyer"><input type="hidden" name="conversation_id" value="<?= (int)$conversation['id'] ?>"><textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="4000" required placeholder="Répondre à cette conversation…"></textarea><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Envoyer la réponse →</button></form></section>
<style>.admin-chat-thread{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;max-height:58vh;overflow:auto;padding:4px}.admin-chat-message{max-width:78%;border:1px solid #e7e7ed;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px}.admin-chat-message.staff{align-self:flex-end;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary) 9%,#fff);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary) 20%,#e7e7ed)}.admin-chat-message.system{align-self:center;max-width:90%;background:#fff8e9}.admin-chat-message>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.admin-chat-message strong{font-size:11px}.admin-chat-message small{font-size:8px;color:#8b91a0}.admin-chat-message p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;margin:7px 0 0}.admin-chat-message a{font-size:9px;font-weight:700}.admin-chat-reply{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;padding-top:16px;display:grid;gap:10px}.admin-chat-reply textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #dfe1e7;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;resize:vertical;font:500 11px 'DM Sans',sans-serif}.admin-chat-reply .btn{justify-self:end}</style>
